      "from": "## \u26a1 Code Review Update: `APPROVE`\n\n### 1. Synchronization Summary\n\nThis pull request updates the `authlib` package from version 1.7.2 to 1.9.1 within the `uv.lock` file. This change is a routine dependency update and does not impact application code as `authlib` is a transitive dependency that is not directly imported or invoked in the current codebase.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Audit Dimension Scorecard\n\n| Dimension | Status | Notes |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| **Logic & Boundaries** | `\u2705 PASS` | Dependency update is confined to `uv.lock`. No behavioral changes in application logic. |\n| **Concurrency & State** | `\u2705 PASS` | No concurrency-related changes introduced. |\n| **Security & Secrets** | `\u2705 PASS` | Updating `authlib` to 1.9.1 includes security patches and improvements. |\n| **Contract Integrity** | `\u2753 UNKNOWN` | Symbol graph analysis skipped (no active workspace). |\n| **Test Coverage & Regressions** | `\u2753 UNKNOWN` | Test impact analysis skipped (no active workspace). |\n\n---\n\n### 3. Semantic Invariants (Model-Asserted)\n\n* The `authlib` dependency is managed transitively; no direct code imports exist.\n* Updating `authlib` does not alter the primary runtime behavior of the Hannibal Hub agents.\n\n<!-- hannibal-review-metadata: {\"version\":1,\"type\":\"sync\",\"verdict\":\"APPROVE\",\"resolutions\":[],\"critical_issues\":[],\"minor_suggestions\":[],\"unverified_claims\":[],\"scorecard\":[{\"dimension\":\"Logic & Boundaries\",\"status\":\"PASS\",\"notes\":\"Dependency update is confined to `uv.lock`. No behavioral changes in application logic.\"},{\"dimension\":\"Concurrency & State\",\"status\":\"PASS\",\"notes\":\"No concurrency-related changes introduced.\"},{\"dimension\":\"Security & Secrets\",\"status\":\"PASS\",\"notes\":\"Updating `authlib` to 1.9.1 includes security patches and improvements.\"},{\"dimension\":\"Contract Integrity\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"notes\":\"Symbol graph analysis skipped (no ac